commits.body:
XP 500 + 225(L-1); arrivals 2.5 + level; shoppers at once 2 + 4 per till + level/2 (cap 20);
lists 1 + randi() % (2 + level), cap 16; start rent $20; costs 10% lower across the board.
The soak AI buys a till first, then licences, shelving, the shed and one restocker, then
expansions; it borrows only for a till's spot or a licence. The 2nd and 3rd tills stand in the
E3 wings and a chest freezer fits in the start store. ECONOMY.md and GDD follow the data;
order_test reads costs from products.json.
